From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Port AZH4 Separate app sound selection gates

Reason: settings-tail71.txt:41 reports the legacy all-apps patch misses AZH4's
additional footer child handling. Bypass only the two five-app selection tests,
keeping saveSelectAppList, unlink handling and footer enabling unchanged.
Files: scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh and unica/mods/settings/a376b patch.
Verification: two exact branch changes, real module dispatch PASS in
settings-smali72.txt:1, standalone Smali assembly, replay72; full build pending.
Runtime selection of six or more apps remains unverified.

---
--- a/scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh
+++ b/scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh
@@ -163,6 +163,12 @@
         if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ] && \
                 [[ "$p" == */paradigm/smali/system/priv-app/EnvironmentAdaptiveDisplay/EnvironmentAdaptiveDisplay.apk/* ]]; then
             LOGW "Adaptive colour-tone feature is omitted for M2; skipping its standalone APK patches"
+            continue
+        fi
+        if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ] && \
+                [[ "$p" == */settings/smali/system/priv-app/MultiSoundSetting/MultiSoundSetting.apk/0001-Allow-more-than-five-apps.patch ]]; then
+            APPLY_PATCH "$PARTITION" "$FILE" \
+                "$SRC_DIR/unica/mods/settings/a376b/0001-Allow-more-than-five-apps.patch"
             continue
         fi
         APPLY_PATCH "$PARTITION" "$FILE" "$p"
